  itemDescription: '"Jon bought five apples, he gave it to Kimberly. Kimberly ate
    two and gave one to Joana, from which, out of gratitude, she exchanged five oranges
    in return. Joana was disapointed to find out that one of her oranges had spoiled.
    Now, how many fresh fruit does Kimberly currently have?"'
